  "translation": "By the hand of your messengers you have reproached Adonai, and have said: “With my chariots I have gone up to the height of the mountains, to the innermost recesses of Lebanon; and I will cut down the height of its cedars, the choicest of its cypresses; and I will enter the lodging of its farthest end, the forest of its orchard.”",
